 "raw": "<|det|>text [112, 126, 943, 339]<|/det|>The osganisms in geographical region had to be distributed. A species on the fresh water ecosystem like fresh prawn are freed due to water pollution. If one pollute the fresh water many species are got disturbed.\n<|det|>text [112, 372, 903, 552]<|/det|>We can use the \"3\" principle here to reduce the wastes that are made in house. Firstly we have to separate the waste absorbed on the degradable carbon.\n<|det|>text [120, 580, 955, 748]<|/det|>we can use the\"composting method do manage the domestic waste, we can use the \"degradable water to feed with animals, berries (poultry), etc..\n<|det|>text [124, 755, 955, 860]<|/det|>It will help to reduce the waste in the environment and doesn't affect the ecosystem."
